    {
      "clientId": "p1-self-client",
      "enabled": true,
      "name": "P1 Self OIDC Client",
      "description": "OIDC client used by P1 for silent re-auth when its HttpSession expired but the KC session is alive. Back-channel logout URL lets KC notify P1 when its SSO session ends (idle timeout / admin revoke). See CLAUDE.md (Phase 15-17) for the full rationale.",
